      `the distributor has informed the authorities competent for the high-risk AI system concerned` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you informed the authorities competent for the high-risk AI system concerned?
      `the information gives details of the non-compliance and of any corrective actions taken` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the information gives details of the non-compliance and of any corrective actions taken?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under Article 24(4), as a distributor, have I immediately informed the provider or importer and the competent authorities of the risk presented by the high-risk AI system, giving details` MEANS
    `Art 24(4) the distributor has immediately informed the provider or importer and the competent authorities of the risk` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` `the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)` `the distributor has informed the provider or importer of the system` `the distributor has informed the authorities competent for the high-risk AI system concerned` `the information gives details of the non-compliance and of any corrective actions taken`
    WHERE
