§ `Article 75b: Commitments`
-- Arises only if the operator has offered commitments during proceedings of the AI Office.

-- Calls `Art 75b first sentence the AI Office may make the commitments binding on the operator and declare that there are no further grounds for action`.
@export Under Article 75b, as a distributor, may the AI Office make my commitments binding on me and declare that there are no further grounds for action?
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE @desc On what date do you want the answer? Give today's date for the Regulation as it stands today, or an earlier or later date for the Regulation as it stood or will stand then.
      `during proceedings under Article 75a(2) the operator concerned offers commitments to ensure compliance with the relevant provisions of this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that during proceedings under Article 75a(2) the operator concerned offers commitments to ensure compliance with the relevant provisions of this Regulation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under Article 75b, as a distributor, may the AI Office make my commitments binding on me and declare that there are no further grounds for action` IS
    `Art 75b first sentence the AI Office may make the commitments binding on the operator and declare that there are no further grounds for action` `the date asked` `during proceedings under Article 75a(2) the operator concerned offers commitments to ensure compliance with the relevant provisions of this Regulation`

-- Calls `Art 75b second sentence the AI Office may reopen the proceedings`.
